From 379d727ab369fabc7921f830ee914adedd7a61d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:39:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD reviewed-feature confirmation so accepted patch chats
 can close

Successful review results put the patch-agent session into an explicit confirmation state. Accepting the confirmation records the closed state locally instead of resuming the backend, while declined or follow-up input reopens the session so additional work can continue.
